Package: PartialAssociationExplorer
Type: Project
Title: Interactive Exploration of Marginal and Conditional Associations
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Thaddée", "D'haegeleer", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Cédric", "Heuchenne", role = "aut"),
    person("Antoine", "Soetewey", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8159-0804"))
  )
Description: A Shiny application for comparing marginal and conditional
    association structures in mixed-type data. The application supports
    numerical-numerical, numerical-categorical, and categorical-categorical
    variable pairs with type-specific tests, network displays, and local
    diagnostics.
